---
import Signup from './Signup.astro';
---
<section class="section final" aria-labelledby="final-title">
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="section-rule"></div>
    <h2 id="final-title" class="display h2 c-text" data-reveal>Start from what you already know.</h2>
    <p class="lede c-text final-lede" data-reveal>Join the early-access list, and we’ll write when your invitation is ready.</p>
    <div class="c-text final-form"><Signup id="email-bottom" halo /></div>
    <p class="note c-note final-note" data-reveal>
      Behind these pages, Archimedes measures a circle: hexagons inside and outside it, their
      sides doubled at each section, to 96. That was enough to show that π lies between
      3&#8239;<span class="frac">10/71</span> and 3&#8239;<span class="frac">1/7</span>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .final-lede { margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 2); }
  .final-form { margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 4); }
  .frac { font-variant-numeric: diagonal-fractions; }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .final-note { grid-row: 2 / span 3; align-self: end; } }
</style>
